      "line": 1,
      "text": "# Polymarket CTF Exchange V2"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "The CTF Exchange V2 is the core smart contract system for trading [Conditional Token Framework](https://docs.gnosis.io/conditionaltokens/) (CTF) assets on Polymarket. It implements operator-driven order matching with support for multiple settlement types, signature schemes, and a wrapped collateral layer."
    },
