      "text": "    ├── CollateralToken.sol             — PMCT (PolyMarket Collateral Token)"
    },
    {
      "line": 86,
      "text": "    ├── CollateralOnramp.sol            — Wrap USDC/USDCe → PMCT"
    },
    {
      "line": 87,
      "text": "    └── CollateralOfframp.sol           — Unwrap PMCT → USDC/USDCe"
    },
    {
      "line": 97,
      "text": "   - **MINT** (both BUY) — Collateral split into outcome tokens via CTF"
    },
    {
      "line": 98,
      "text": "   - **MERGE** (both SELL) — Outcome tokens merged back into collateral via CTF"
    },
    {
      "line": 111,
      "text": "### Collateral System"
    },
    {
      "line": 113,
      "text": "The exchange trades in **PMCT** (PolyMarket Collateral Token), an ERC20 wrapper around USDC/USDCe:"
    },
    {
      "line": 114,
      "text": "- **CollateralOnramp**: Wraps supported assets into PMCT"
    },
    {
      "line": 115,
      "text": "- **CollateralOfframp**: Unwraps PMCT back to supported assets"
    },
    {
      "line": 116,
      "text": "- **CtfCollateralAdapter**: Bridges PMCT ↔ CTF operations (split/merge/redeem)"
    },
    {
      "line": 125,
      "text": "- **Wrapped collateral (PMCT)** — New collateral token layer with onramp/offramp, replacing direct USDC usage. Enables the collateral adapter pattern for CTF interactions."
    },
    {
      "line": 126,
      "text": "- **Configurable max fee rate** — Admin-settable maximum fee rate in basis points (default 500 = 5%), enforced per-order."
    }
